        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n94" value="&lt;b&gt;Found along the way&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The earlier DEM loader shifted the surface by part of a cell: 0.25 m NMAD against exact interpolation, 0.01 m after the fix. Earlier DEM correction runs used the old loader.&lt;br&gt;• A strip-by-strip run equals the single-pass run to 0.000000 m.&lt;br&gt;• Memory: DEMNAS 8 m over Sugihan-Lumpur runs in strips with at least 2 km overlap, never coarsened.&lt;br&gt;• The 25 cm KLHK contours were traced from the 20/25 m LiDAR; the BRGM contours from the modelled DTMs.&lt;br&gt;• The LiDAR is held out: it never enters a fit." style="fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontColor=#1F2A30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=6;strokeWidth=1.25;fillColor=#F4F6F6;strokeColor=#B8C4C2;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
